==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{der|sh|sla-pro}}. Cognate with {{cog|bg|радея|t=care for}}, {{cog|ru|радеть|t=care for}}. Non-Slavic cognates include {{cog|os|рад|t=order}}, {{cog|sa|राध्यते}}, {{m|sa|राधति}} and {{m|sa|राध्नोति|tr=rādhnóti|t=succeed}}, {{cog|got|𐌲𐌰𐍂𐌴𐌳𐌰𐌽}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sh|/rǎːditi/}}
* {{hyph|sh|ра|ди|ти}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=ра́дити|a=impf}}

